# Keep the published archive small.
#
# pub.dev only needs the example's Dart source to display and score it. The
# platform scaffolds are generated by `flutter create` and are hundreds of
# kilobytes of Xcode projects, CMake files and app icons that nobody consumes
# from a pub archive -- anyone running the example clones the repository.
#
# Dropping them takes the archive from ~242 KB to ~15 KB, which also makes the
# upload far less likely to die on a slow connection.
android/
ios/
macos/
windows/
linux/
web/
